    <briefdescription>
<para>CHOOSE(index, val1, val2, ...) - Choose by index (Excel-compatible). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Returns the value at the specified index (1-based like Excel).</para>
<para>Examples: CHOOSE(2, &quot;a&quot;, &quot;b&quot;, &quot;c&quot;) =&gt; &quot;b&quot; CHOOSE(1, 10, 20, 30) =&gt; 10 </para>
    </detaileddescription>
